# Prada L'Homme Intense-inspired Astra V1 — DIAGNOSTIC PROJECTION ONLY

Formula ID: PLI-ASTRA-V1-DIAGNOSTIC.
Target: Prada L'Homme Intense; original inspired design, not a proprietary recreation.
Status: NOT A COMPOUNDING CARD. Parent formula: none.
Artificial interface projection: one nominal mass mg from the exact 6000 mg master is encoded as one surrogate µL. Stock densities have NOT been measured or assumed true. All reported volumes and OAV values are model-only. The exact gravimetric master is formulas/Prada_LHomme_Intense_Astra_V1_30mL_EDP.md.
Prepared Coumarin/Heliotropal rows are planned, not existing bottles.
Unknown Intense family must remain explicit. Do not apply a base-Prada or Dior family contract.
No finished ethanol/matrix mass has been measured; batch volume is a nominal simulator parameter, not a complete mass-matrix declaration.

